@startuml Sequence Diagram - Creare Programare

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

title Diagramă Secvență - Creare Programare Medicală

actor "Pacient" as Patient
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Route\n/app/api/appointments" as API
participant "DB Helpers\nappointmentHelpers" as DBHelpers
database "SQLite\nDatabase" as Database
participant "Notification\nService" as Notification

Patient -> Frontend: Accesează pagina new-appointment
Frontend -> Frontend: Încarcă lista specializări
Frontend -> Frontend: Încarcă lista medici
Frontend -> Frontend: Încarcă pachete analize

Patient -> Frontend: Selectează specializare
Frontend -> Frontend: Filtrează medici după specializare

Patient -> Frontend: Selectează doctor
Frontend -> Frontend: Afișează metadate doctor

Patient -> Frontend: Selectează pachet analize (opțional)
Patient -> Frontend: Selectează dată și oră
Patient -> Frontend: Completează motiv consultație
Patient -> Frontend: Submit formular

Frontend -> API: POST /api/appointments\n{userId, patientId, primaryPhysician,\nschedule, reason, note}

API -> DBHelpers: createAppointment(params)
DBHelpers -> Database: INSERT INTO appointments
Database --> DBHelpers: appointmentId
DBHelpers --> API: Appointment object

API -> Notification: createNotification(\nuserId, "appointment_created")
Notification -> Database: INSERT INTO notifications
Database --> Notification: notificationId
Notification --> API: Success

API --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{appointmentId, success: true}

Frontend -> Frontend: Redirect la success page
Frontend -> Patient: Afișează confirmare programare

@enduml
